B.a_g=new A.d5("The Blue Kite","Mia has a blue kite. A soft wind lifts it high. The kite dips, spins, and climbs. Mia holds the string with both hands. Her kite sails above the park.")
B.a_e=new A.d5("A Helpful Pup","Pip is a small brown dog. He sees a red ball by the gate. Pip picks it up and trots home. His tail wags all the way. What a helpful pup!")
B.a_j=new A.d5("Garden Day","We dig small holes in the soil. We plant one seed in each hole. Then we add a little water. Soon green leaves peek out. Our garden has begun to grow.")
B.a_2=new A.d5("The Lost Sock","One yellow sock sat on the chair. Its match was not in the drawer. Leo looked under the bed. There it was beside a toy train. The pair was together again.")
